; A bucket account completes only a transaction with exactly one posting
; (src/xact.cc, xact_base_t::finalize: "posts.size() == 1").  An
; unbalanced two-posting transaction is rejected even under a bucket.

bucket Assets:Cash

2024/01/01 Two postings, unbalanced
    Expenses:Food    $10
    Expenses:Gas     $5

test bal -> 1
